00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Hi! We're Chia and Jacy, team BoboMimi.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Our challenge: the Earth Information Jukebox.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
This is TerraJuke: hear NASA's view of our planet.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Pick a NASA visualization and press Play.
Its colours become real values: warmer plays higher.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Touch any place to hear its story, from 1890 to today.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Seven NASA records, with captions and keyboard control.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Imagine every Earth Information Center screen you can also hear. TerraJuke.
